AiTask qa5_t00_weekly_category_revenue {
  label: 'QA5 T00 Weekly Category Revenue'
  description: 'Calculates a fresh revenue summary by category for the most recent completed Monday–Sunday week and emails it to the specified recipient.'

  brief: @md
    Use @Dataset:ecommerce_official only. Always query fresh database data; do not reuse cached, prior-run, or assumed values. Use the governed `revenue` metric, `orders.created_at` as the reporting timestamp, and `categories.name` as the category grouping. Do not invent data, dates, recipients, delivery outcomes, or subject text.

    This task is scheduled to run on Monday. Determine all boundaries in workspace time. Calculate the most recent completed Monday–Sunday week immediately preceding the Monday run: from the preceding Monday at 00:00:00 inclusive through the current run Monday at 00:00:00 exclusive. Do not include any data from the run Monday or use a rolling seven-day window. Retain and state the exact inclusive/exclusive date boundaries used.

    Query fresh revenue grouped by `categories.name` for that complete-week window. Produce a concise, grounded category-level revenue summary that identifies the completed-week date range and reports each returned category with its revenue. Make it clear when a category has no returned revenue rows; do not fabricate zero-value categories.

    Use the available direct AI delivery capability despite older documentation. Email the summary to only `nhi.ty@holistics.io`, with no CC, BCC, attachments, or other recipients. The email subject must begin exactly `[QA5 T00]` and the email body must be grounded in the fresh query results. Finish by recording the exact date window, category-level revenue results, email recipient, subject, and actual delivery outcome without representing an undelivered email as delivered.
  ;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Uses only fresh data from @Dataset:ecommerce_official and the governed `revenue` metric, grouped by `categories.name`, with `orders.created_at` as the reporting timestamp; it invents no data, dates, category rows, recipients, subject text, or delivery outcome.
    - Uses the correct complete-week window for the Monday run: [preceding Monday 00:00:00, current run Monday 00:00:00) in workspace time, covering exactly the immediately preceding Monday–Sunday calendar week and excluding the run Monday.
    - Produces a concise category-level Revenue summary from the fresh results that states the exact completed-week boundaries and reports revenue for every returned `categories.name` value.
    - Successfully sends the grounded summary by email to only `nhi.ty@holistics.io`, with no CC, BCC, attachment, or additional recipient.
    - The delivered email subject begins exactly `[QA5 T00]`.
  ;;
}